OL,3,AParamount settles lawsuit with US
OL,4,Astates, clearing way for $110bn merger
OL,5,Awith Warner Bros
OL,6,
OL,7,FParamount Skydance has settled a
OL,8,Flawsuit with dozens of US states,
OL,9,Fpaving the way for its $110bn (#82.8bn)
OL,10,Fmerger with Warner Bros Discovery.
OL,12,FCalifornia Attorney General Rob Bonta
OL,13,Fsaid state officials agreed to terms
OL,14,Fafter securing commitments to protect
OL,15,Fcompetition across film and television,
OL,16,Fand broadcasting.
OL,18,FStill, "the settlement is not a vote of
OL,19,Fsupport for this merger," Bonta said.
OL,20,F"I don't think these two companies
OL,21,Fshould merge."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
