OL,3,AParamount settles lawsuit with US
OL,4,Astates, clearing way for $110bn merger
OL,5,Awith Warner Bros
OL,6,
OL,7,FParamount chief executive David Ellison
OL,8,Fhailed the resolution, saying: "Our
OL,9,Fshared aim was an outcome that best
OL,10,Fserves consumers, workers and - most
OL,11,Fimportantly -the creative community so
OL,12,Fvital to the art of visual
OL,13,Fstorytelling."
